{"parentUuid":"08eaf506-1864-491c-abca-9e193104529f","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ac07b073c0dacf54f","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cg22Qtf95z9CFJiGDKhoR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LTRaMVCRGGEuyEACsmWEhd","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://www.multiecuscan.net/SupportedVehiclesList.aspx","prompt":"What does this page say about supported functions per module for Alfa Romeo Stelvio and Giulia 2.0T (modules, parameters, actuators, adjustments, coding)? List any concrete function/procedure names and module names shown."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3197,"cache_read_input_tokens":140769,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3197,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LTRaMVCRGGEuyEACsmWEhd":{"url":"https://www.multiecuscan.net/SupportedVehiclesList.aspx","prompt":"What does this page say about supported functions per module for Alfa Romeo Stelvio and Giulia 2.0T (modules, parameters, actuators, adjustments, coding)? List any concrete function/procedure names and module names shown."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"3122c40f-1798-4cdc-b568-276a43960123","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cg22QtNWt3PexyNizudAs","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"aa00699a-cca8-4ce5-83de-df6cfa1ad480","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:09:06.973Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"08eaf506-1864-491c-abca-9e193104529f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"cde09b07-6881-403c-9d9a-f467b27b1473","agentId":"ac07b073c0dacf54f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HPRU2jqRJ1YBtfWts93Ka1","type":"tool_result","content":"# MultiEcuScan (MES) Functions for Alfa Romeo Giulia/Stelvio\n\nBased on the provided content, here are the documented MES functions:\n\n## Body Module\n- **\"Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 Turbo 16V Multiair → Body → CAN Setup / PROXI ALIGNMENT PROCEDURE (952)\"** - Initial alignment procedure with cable switching\n- **Body → CAN Setup** - Adjustments tab for PROXI byte editing (Ctrl+Alt+C)\n- **Dynamic Control Selector** - Race mode configuration (MES 4.5+)\n- **Cruise Control/ACC settings** - Enable ACC+ functionality\n- **Byte 156, bits 4-5** - EU paddle shifter logic configuration\n- **Byte 58, bit 1** - Window comfort opening/closing enable\n- **Byte 126, bit 5** - After-wipe feature configuration\n- **Byte 63, bits 0-3** - Battery type registration\n- **\"Cornering Lights\"** - Static bending lights activation option\n\n## ABS Module\n- **\"ABS / Continental ABS MK C1 module\"** - Requires gray cable connection\n- **Parameters tab** - Steering angle sensor check (0° calibration)\n- **Reset steering angle** - Adjustments procedure\n- **\"Lateral and longitudinal acceleration sensor calibration\"** - Adjustments procedure\n- **Pressure sensor calibration** - Adjustments procedure\n\n## Other Modules\n- **Dashboard → Instrument Panel** - Seat belt chime disable (Adjustments tab)\n- **Body → RFHub → Adjustments** - TPMS pressure threshold adjustment (MES ≥4.7R3)"}]},"uuid":"501248b5-9bfb-4d83-a90b-c1830bdf6930","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:09:13.121Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":73422,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# MultiEcuScan (MES) Functions for Alfa Romeo Giulia/Stelvio\n\nBased on the provided content, here are the documented MES functions:\n\n## Body Module\n- **\"Alfa Romeo Giulia 2.0 Turbo 16V Multiair → Body → CAN Setup / PROXI ALIGNMENT PROCEDURE (952)\"** - Initial alignment procedure with cable switching\n- **Body → CAN Setup** - Adjustments tab for PROXI byte editing (Ctrl+Alt+C)\n- **Dynamic Control Selector** - Race mode configuration (MES 4.5+)\n- **Cruise Control/ACC settings** - Enable ACC+ functionality\n- **Byte 156, bits 4-5** - EU paddle shifter logic configuration\n- **Byte 58, bit 1** - Window comfort opening/closing enable\n- **Byte 126, bit 5** - After-wipe feature configuration\n- **Byte 63, bits 0-3** - Battery type registration\n- **\"Cornering Lights\"** - Static bending lights activation option\n\n## ABS Module\n- **\"ABS / Continental ABS MK C1 module\"** - Requires gray cable connection\n- **Parameters tab** - Steering angle sensor check (0° calibration)\n- **Reset steering angle** - Adjustments procedure\n- **\"Lateral and longitudinal acceleration sensor calibration\"** - Adjustments procedure\n- **Pressure sensor calibration** - Adjustments procedure\n\n## Other Modules\n- **Dashboard → Instrument Panel** - Seat belt chime disable (Adjustments tab)\n- **Body → RFHub → Adjustments** - TPMS pressure threshold adjustment (MES ≥4.7R3)","durationMs":5830,"url":"https://giuliatech.com/t/multiecuscan-mes-popular-settings-compilation/80"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3122c40f-1798-4cdc-b568-276a43960123","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"08eaf506-1864-491c-abca-9e193104529f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"aa00699a-cca8-4ce5-83de-df6cfa1ad480","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"cde09b07-6881-403c-9d9a-f467b27b1473","agentId":"ac07b073c0dacf54f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LTRaMVCRGGEuyEACsmWEhd","type":"tool_result","content":"# Alfa Romeo Stelvio & Giulia 2.0T Supported Functions\n\n## Giulia 2.0 Turbo 16V MultiAir\n\n**Engine Control:**\n- \"Magneti Marelli IAW 10JA CF6/EOBD Injection (2.0)\" with INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ACT|ADJ functions\n\n**Transmission:**\n- \"ZF 8HP50/75 Automatic Gearbox\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ADJ\n- \"ZF Electronic Gear Shift Module\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ACT\n\n**Chassis & Safety:**\n- \"Continental ABS MK C1\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ACT|ADJ\n- Bosch radar and camera systems\n- \"Bosch Airbag\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM\n- \"ZF Electric Steering\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ADJ\n\n**Comfort Systems:**\n- Climate control, adaptive headlights, parking sensors, TPMS\n- Body Computer with \"CAN Setup / PROXI Alignment Procedure\"\n\n## Stelvio 2.0 Turbo 16V MultiAir\n\nIdentical module lineup to Giulia 2.0T, including the same engine, transmission, ABS, airbag, steering, and ancillary systems with matching function capabilities (INFO, DTC, PRM, ACT, ADJ)."}]},"uuid":"69294575-cb48-4111-a102-4006ccb79723","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:09:14.924Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":1295889,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Alfa Romeo Stelvio & Giulia 2.0T Supported Functions\n\n## Giulia 2.0 Turbo 16V MultiAir\n\n**Engine Control:**\n- \"Magneti Marelli IAW 10JA CF6/EOBD Injection (2.0)\" with INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ACT|ADJ functions\n\n**Transmission:**\n- \"ZF 8HP50/75 Automatic Gearbox\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ADJ\n- \"ZF Electronic Gear Shift Module\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ACT\n\n**Chassis & Safety:**\n- \"Continental ABS MK C1\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ACT|ADJ\n- Bosch radar and camera systems\n- \"Bosch Airbag\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM\n- \"ZF Electric Steering\" – INFO|DTC|DTC EX|PRM|ADJ\n\n**Comfort Systems:**\n- Climate control, adaptive headlights, parking sensors, TPMS\n- Body Computer with \"CAN Setup / PROXI Alignment Procedure\"\n\n## Stelvio 2.0 Turbo 16V MultiAir\n\nIdentical module lineup to Giulia 2.0T, including the same engine, transmission, ABS, airbag, steering, and ancillary systems with matching function capabilities (INFO, DTC, PRM, ACT, ADJ).","durationMs":7629,"url":"https://www.multiecuscan.net/SupportedVehiclesList.aspx"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3122c40f-1798-4cdc-b568-276a43960123","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"aa00699a-cca8-4ce5-83de-df6cfa1ad480","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
